 "description": "<p>A Christmas-red Chinese cheongsam in polyester with matching thong, one size for 40-55 kg in M and up in L. The Chinese-style cut is the costume - the red is seasonal, the silhouette is the genre.</p>\n<p>The cheongsam collar and closure construction hold the line that makes this read as cheongsam rather than red dress. M runs 40-55 kg, L runs 55-65 kg, and the L label follows the larger band.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: cheongsam, thong</li>\n<li>Style: Chinese cheongsam, Christmas red</li>\n<li>Color: red</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-55 kg), L (55-65 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by weight band. The holiday-colorway entry in the cheongsam family that runs four listings deep on the site.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Red Christmas Chinese cheongsam with thong in polyester, M and L sizes for 40-65 kg.</p>\n",
